<style>
.dsr{font:var(--gw-text-body-14-reg);color:var(--gw-color-black);display:flex;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start}
.dsr figure{margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.dsr figcaption{font:var(--gw-text-body-12-med);color:var(--gw-color-neutral-600)}
.dsr .v{width:240px;background:var(--gw-color-neutral-100);border-radius:var(--gw-radius-16);padding:4px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}
.dsr .v span{height:36px;padding:0 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-radius:var(--gw-radius-12);font:var(--gw-text-body-14-med);color:var(--gw-color-neutral-700)}
.dsr .v span.on{background:#fff;color:var(--gw-color-black);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--gw-color-neutral-200)}
.dsr em{font:var(--gw-text-body-12-med);font-style:normal;color:var(--gw-color-neutral-500)}
.dsr .h{display:inline-flex;height:36px;padding:4px;background:var(--gw-color-neutral-100);border-radius:var(--gw-radius-12)}
.dsr .h span{height:28px;padding:0 10px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:var(--gw-radius-8);font:var(--gw-text-body-14-med);color:var(--gw-color-neutral-700)}
.dsr .h span.on{background:#fff;color:var(--gw-color-black);box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--gw-color-neutral-200)}
.dsr .h span.off{opacity:.5}
.dsr .pin{font:var(--gw-text-body-12-reg);color:var(--gw-color-neutral-500)}
</style>
<div class="dsr">
 <figure><div class="v"><span class="on">All bundles<em>33</em></span><span>Generate more leads<em>3</em></span><span>Lead to Quote<em>8</em></span><span>Order Desk<em>6</em></span><span>Purchasing<em>7</em></span><span>Cash<em>5</em></span><span>Quality and Paperwork<em>4</em></span></div><div class="pin">Sticky: stays in view while the grid scrolls</div><figcaption>Vertical tab group, container 16 = row 12 + padding 4</figcaption></figure>
 <figure><div class="h"><span class="on">All<em>33</em></span><span>Approved<em>2</em></span><span>To review<em>1</em></span><span class="off">Requested<em>0</em></span></div><figcaption>The same pattern, horizontal, for the status filter. A tab with no agents is dimmed and cannot be chosen.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
